LCS of `abcde` and `ace`:

| | "" | a | c | e |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| "" | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |
| a | 0 | **1** | 1 | 1 |
| b | 0 | 1 | 1 | 1 |
| c | 0 | 1 | **2** | 2 |
| d | 0 | 1 | 2 | 2 |
| e | 0 | 1 | 2 | **3** |

Bold cells are matches (diagonal + 1). The answer is the bottom-right: 3.

