| x | 0 | 1 | 2 | 3 | 4 | 5 | 6 |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| fewest[x] | 0 | 1 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 2 | **2** |

fewest[6] = 1 + min(fewest[5], fewest[3], fewest[2]) = 1 + 1 = 2 (3 + 3).

